
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Nexa A2A - Index-V1.0.0</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@600;800&family=Rajdhani:wght@500;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Font Awesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #080c14;
            color: #ffffff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px 15px;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 800px;
        }

        /* Header / Meta Info */
        .version-tag {
            color: #1e88e5;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .meta-text {
            color: #5a6e85;
            font-size: 11px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        /* Navbar / Logo Bar */
        .nav-bar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .logo {
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: #00e5ff;
        }

        .badge-active {
            background: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid #00e5ff;
            color: #00e5ff;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.3;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #cfd8dc 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero h1 .highlight {
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: initial;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .hero p {
            color: #8a99ad;
            font-size: 12px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* Connectivity Map Section */
        .map-section {
            background: #0d131f;
            border: 1px solid #1a2332;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        .section-title {
            color: #00e5ff;
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 13px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .map-flow {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .map-card {
            flex: 1;
            background: #0a0f18;
            border: 1px solid #1e293b;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 20px 10px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .map-card.super-ai {
            border-color: #8b5cf6;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
        }

        .map-card i {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .map-card:nth-child(1) i { color: #00e5ff; }
        .map-card:nth-child(3) i { color: #00e5ff; }
        .map-card:nth-child(5) i { color: #a855f7; }

        .map-card h3 {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .map-card p {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 10px;
        }

        .connector {
            flex: 0 0 30px;
            height: 2px;
            background: #1e293b;
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .connector::after {
            content: '';
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            background: #8b5cf6;
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 0 6px #8b5cf6;
        }

        /* Features Grid */
        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: #0d131f;
            border: 1px solid #1a2332;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 18px 15px;
        }

        .feature-card i {
            color: #00e5ff;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .feature-card h4 {
            color: #00e5ff;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .feature-card p {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 11px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 10px;
            padding: 10px 0;
        }

        /* Mobile Responsive adjustment */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .features-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .map-flow {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 15px;
            }
            .connector {
                width: 2px;
                height: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header Info -->
        <div class="version-tag">Index-V1.0.0</div>
        <div class="meta-text">Intranl of my ai project &lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</div>

        <!-- Navbar -->
        <div class="nav-bar">
            <div class="logo">NEXA <span>A2A</span></div>
            <div class="badge-active">NEXT-GEN AI ACTIVE</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <div class="hero">
            <h1>सुपर AI को जोड़ने वाला भारत का पहला <span class="highlight">A2A</span><br>नेटवर्क</h1>
            <p>Nexa A2A (Agent-to-Agent Protocol) विभिन्न एआई एजेंट्स और भविष्य के Super AI को एक शक्तिशाली नेटवर्क में जोड़ता है।</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Connectivity Map Section -->
        <div class="map-section">
            <div class="section-title">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-sitemap"></i> NEXA A2A SUPER AI CONNECTIVITY MAP
            </div>
            <div class="map-flow">
                <div class="map-card">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-robot"></i>
                    <h3>Nexa Agent A</h3>
                    <p>Task Processing</p>
                </div>

                <div class="connector"></div>

                <div class="map-card">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip"></i>
                    <h3>A2A Protocol</h3>
                    <p>Smart Router</p>
                </div>

                <div class="connector"></div>

                <div class="map-card super-ai">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-brain"></i>
                    <h3>SUPER AI</h3>
                    <p>Central Intelligence</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Features Grid -->
        <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i>
                <h4>Ultra Fast A2A Bridge</h4>
                <p>एजेंट-टू-एजेंट प्रोटोकॉल के जरिए बिना किसी रुकावट के डेटा ट्रांसफर और रियल-टाइम कम्युनिकेशन।</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
                <h4>Secure Integration</h4>
                <p>सुपर एआई और लोकली होस्टेड एआई मॉडल्स के बीच सुरक्षित और एन्क्रिप्टेड कनेक्शन।</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch"></i>
                <h4>Scalable Architecture</h4>
                <p>भविष्य के एडवांस एआई मॉडल्स और बैकएंड API से सीधे कनेक्ट करने के लिए तैयार डिज़ाइन।</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <footer>
            © 2026 Nexa A2A Project. Made in India for the Future of AI.
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
